            "value": "Export all finished items to a folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実測では、whisper と parakeet の11分の比較で、判定145件のうち138件が読みの不一致でした。読みが違う箇所は音響に情報が残っているため、テキストだけの判断は確度が落ちます。既定では切ってあり、その分は判定せず人の確認に残します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a measured comparison of whisper against parakeet over 11 minutes, 138 of 145 judgements involved differing readings. Where the readings differ, information remains in the audio, so judging from text alone is less reliable. This is off by default, leaving those cases for a person to check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "実行のたびに出力が変わる（同じ音声・同じ設定で 753 / 758 / 759 文字）。同一インスタンス内なら一致するが、プロセスをまたぐと一致しない。temperature=0・seed 固定・スレッド1でも消えず、原因は未特定。照合の相手にすると「前回は決着した箇所が今回は未決」が起き、CER を測っても再現しない。速度も 6.7 倍速と他の 5〜10 分の1。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Output changes every run (753 / 758 / 759 characters for the same audio and settings). Runs match within one instance but not across processes; temperature=0, a fixed seed, and one thread do not remove it and the cause is unknown. Used as a cross-checker it can leave previously decided spots undecided, and CER measurements do not reproduce. It is also 6.7x slower than the others."
          }
        }
      }
    },
